OL,3,GNEWSAFormer DUP leader Donaldson
OL,4,Asentenced to 15 years in prison for
OL,5,Achild sex abuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe was sentenced to 11 years for his
OL,8,Fcrimes against Victim B and four years
OL,9,Ffor offences against Victim A. Both the
OL,10,Fsentences will run consecutively.
